@startuml
[*] --> Ready
Ready --> SearchQueryEntered : Enter search query
SearchQueryEntered --> SearchResultsDisplayed : Process search
SearchResultsDisplayed --> FilterApplied : Apply filter
SearchResultsDisplayed --> PaginationNavigation : Navigate pages
SearchResultsDisplayed --> SearchRefinement : Refine search
FilterApplied --> SearchResultsDisplayed : Update results
PaginationNavigation --> SearchResultsDisplayed : Update results
SearchRefinement --> SearchQueryEntered : Update query
SearchResultsDisplayed --> [*] : Exit
@enduml
